                                "sense_id": "152265e4-821c-39d7-82b3-2f5db3c37a26",
                                "text": "Either it was one of those upquivering flashes of the spirit, to which minds in an abnormal state are liable, or else the artist had subtly touched some chord that made musical vibration."
                            },
