                                "example_id": "ab0639a5-b357-4266-ace0-0320618aaa2a",
                                "sense_id": "152265e4-821c-39d7-82b3-2f5db3c37a26",
                                "text": "She saw the air upquivering from the baked earth, the ruined wall."
